    "description": "Charming Noe Valley fixer,  2-unit building with huge Eastern views to the bay and salesforce, lovely light, nestled on a large 25x125 foot lot. Great long term development potential, or as-is with some TLC (both unit kitchens have been removed and need updating). Currently unoccupied, this wonderful building offers a unique opportunity to live in one unit and rent out the other, a family/friend compound, or an investment property. Both units host 1-2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, and walkout decks with access to the garden and lower, undeveloped rooms. Walkable Noe Valley location, one block to 24th Street and quick access to multiple parks and green space."
